+Sonnet: claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929
+Haiku:  claude-haiku-4-5-20251001
+```
+
+**Shorthand aliases** (always valid, resolve to current):
+- `opus` → current opus model
+- `sonnet` → current sonnet model
+- `haiku` → current haiku model
